   "text": "GREETING\n\"Hello, welcome to Haqdaar\" in Hindi, English and\nthe 3 main languages of the caller's place.\n\"Speak in any language. For keys, press 6.\"",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "n_greet",
   "originalText": "GREETING\n\"Hello, welcome to Haqdaar\" in Hindi, English and the 3 main languages of the caller's place.\n\"Speak in any language. For keys, press 6.\"",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
