   "versionNonce": 253207297,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1759650000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "THE MODEL (LLM)\nReads the system prompt, the log and this turn.\nDecides the next step:\n1. ask a clarifying question (which one: the fixed\npicker says, see 5)\n2. do a search (RAG)\n3. give the answer to the caller's question (each kind\nof question has its own way of output)\n4. more, as needed: say the last reply again, say\ngoodbye, or \"not for us\"\n5. find schemes by keyword bits (bitmask); the bits\nalso pick the next question",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "n_llm",
   "originalText": "THE MODEL (LLM)\nReads the system prompt, the log and this turn. Decides the next step:\n1. ask a clarifying question (which one: the fixed picker says, see 5)\n2. do a search (RAG)\n3. give the answer to the caller's question (each kind of question has its own way of output)\n4. more, as needed: say the last reply again, say goodbye, or \"not for us\"\n5. find schemes by keyword bits (bitmask); the bits also pick the next question",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
